            4
(1 row)

\c yugabyte phuser
ALTER USER phuser PASSWORD 'pw_two';               -- fail: last 2 passwords are pw_two and pw_five
ERROR:  password matches a recently used password
DETAIL:  The last 2 passwords may not be reused.
HINT:  Choose a password that has not been used recently.
\c yugabyte yugabyte
